    turnFlow: '1. **Partition**: Players divide 6 cards into Hand A and Hand B. 2. **Vying**: Betting rounds proceed as in standard Brag. 3. **Comparison**: Showdown involves comparing corresponding hands. 4. **Ranks**: Prial > Running Flush > Run > Flush > Pair > High Card.',
