      draw: 'All six cards are received at the start; no drawing phase exists during the play of the hand.',
      discard: 'Every card must be partitioned into the two hands; no cards are discarded to a muck pile.',
      pass: 'Players must either bet, see, or fold during their turn; a simple pass is not supported.',
